Killed C_rank and concatenated posting reconstruction: Derived c_membership cleanly via set membership from the top-2 IDF tokens (matching Benchmark 2B's true C universe) without fabricating an arbitrary posting concatenation order.

Replaced categorical source_id = 2/3 with binary is_s2: Uses 1.0 if src == 2 else 0.0.

